    "CoiStatement": "Conflict of interestM. Nassif, C.B.B.C. Heuschen, H. Lu, B.J. Bouma, R.P. van Steenwijk, P.J. Sterk, B.J.M. Mulder and R. J. de Winter state that they have no competing interest.",
    "Article": {
